sequenceDiagram
  autonumber 10
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant R as Production Run
  participant F as Forecast Engine
  participant L as Ledger
  participant X as Exporter
  participant W as Web Build
  participant G as Deployment Gate
  R->>F: forecast months due
  F->>L: append once
  R->>L: record outcomes
  R->>R: production gate
  alt gate failed
    R-->>S: exit 1: stop
  else gate passed
    R->>R: tests, commit state
    R->>X: staged export
    X->>W: tests, build
    W->>G: checks, licence gate
    alt every production source CLEARED
      G-->>S: site uploaded and deployed
    else a licence confirmation is open
      G-->>S: built and checked, not uploaded, licence job fails
    end
  end
